{"data": [{"article": {"title": "ELON CHRON: 2nd of November, 2026"}, "author_id": "1234183597583740929", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:19:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117396193919610970"], "id": "2117396193919610970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 737, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/3fQhOzVq1H", "url": "https://x.com/SERobinsonJr/status/2117396193919610970"}, {"author_id": "164103949", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:12:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117394420899168648"], "id": "2117394420899168648", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117392992952570334", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @cb_doge @elonmusk ~7.5 M customers who pay or have obama phones? What's the monthly and or annual profit? How many locations could be closed. Could the ordering be online? Could @grok @bot assist with ordering service alongside ai on website/app? \nHow could service be as automated and streamlined", "url": "https://x.com/joyfillednomads/status/2117394420899168648"}, {"author_id": "1601618295089598464", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:08:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117393542796788082"], "id": "2117393542796788082", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1106896608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117130257686040837", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Chaos2Cured @elonmusk @spacexai \n\nI won\u2019t say exactly what I am building\u2026 but I can say that building a singular part of it plus 58 tests was only 127k tokens\u2026 now the compute time was approx 55 minutes. \n\nNow Grok Bot has ~800,000 paid weekly users and ~600,000 active users \n\n(The Revenue", "url": "https://x.com/M1K4_James/status/2117393542796788082"}, {"author_id": "1565297971725484037", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:08:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117393428858446322"], "id": "2117393428858446322", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1392919510550663171", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117380236543488066", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@shagbark_hick @normonics I use AI daily and definitely have a love/hate relationship with it. \n\nBut in its proper place it\u2019s an incredible tool which has been a net positive on (ironically) decreasing my technological dependence. \n\nAs one small example, my wife hates figuring out what to make and then", "url": "https://x.com/landlibertylife/status/2117393428858446322"}, {"author_id": "2082249648417165313", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:04:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117392394496663979"], "id": "2117392394496663979", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117360990119506022", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk Grok Bot is pretty awesome. It saves me so much time managing my inbox and keeping my CRM updated.", "url": "https://x.com/StuBowler/status/2117392394496663979"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2117392299109810176"]}, "author_id": "2111431780788051968", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:04:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117392320874123531"], "id": "2117392320874123531", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "One Grok tip, every morning at breakfast \u2615\n\nAsk Grok Bot:\n\"Review my inbox and calendar since yesterday. List what needs me, with sources and whether I owe a decision.\"\n\nhttps://t.co/pzFNpf1HNn\nDownload Grok Bot (paid plan), link in bio\nUnofficial \u00b7 Not affiliated with SpaceXSI https://t.co/zy2rDNDgYI", "url": "https://x.com/BotnBreakfast/status/2117392320874123531"}, {"author_id": "2246145824", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:00:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117391353890160858"], "id": "2117391353890160858", "in_reply_to_user_id": "24544845", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117389569591230640", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CristianCatalin Well I am building https://t.co/5vVOaSolYP, my newsletter on https://t.co/q6dCGO961X. A experiment where Grok Bot is trying to sell a product for me on https://t.co/qWT9nk9ugQ but some things are not public yet \ud83d\ude05", "url": "https://x.com/ThomasKanze/status/2117391353890160858"}, {"author_id": "2105020059059904514", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:47:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117388160782959086"], "id": "2117388160782959086", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1607147145320087555", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117338455906922959", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@aduserx connected my grok bot to t3 code, the bot is the inbox but every complex task gets sent to an opus thread on t3", "url": "https://x.com/luciococoru/status/2117388160782959086"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117387698524545025", "3_2117387698503557120", "3_2117387698516226048", "3_2117387698516250624"]}, "author_id": "840580662", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:45:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117387711958937972"], "id": "2117387711958937972", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Q3 Shareholder update\n\nHighlights\n\u2013 FSD Supervised attach rate grew to over 75% of new vehicle deliveries in NA\n\n\u2013 Unveiled the next-gen Roadster\n\n\u2013 Record deliveries in Canada, Australia, Japan &amp; Taiwan\n\n\u2013 Tesla Semi now in volume production. Top variant can go up to 500 miles https://t.co/v3jAf5IglC", "url": "https://x.com/Philipkcvmx/status/2117387711958937972"}, {"author_id": "1514681252426747904", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:45:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117387536540614777"], "id": "2117387536540614777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You do not have to throw away your local Mac agents when you adopt a cloud agent box. The real magic happens when you wire them together with clear boundaries.\n\nOur 15 seats span three distinct agent eras working as one fireteam:\n\n1. Era 1 (OpenClaw on Mac Mini - Earle): The", "url": "https://x.com/REXLogos/status/2117387536540614777"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117387309607747584"]}, "author_id": "1546681920993607681", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:44:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117387389542756592"], "id": "2117387389542756592", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 221, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The robot era isn't coming someday. It's coming to your house. \ud83e\udd16\u26a1\n\nWhen @Tesla_Optimus rolls out, the people who get the most out of it won't be the ones with the fanciest gear. They'll be the ones who already know how to TALK to AI and hand it real work.\n\nThat's exactly what https://t.co/fb8vPRGRmR", "url": "https://x.com/hotwire405/status/2117387389542756592"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117384714503753728"]}, "author_id": "2016367819189862401", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:33:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117384747924193333"], "id": "2117384747924193333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 94, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "#Newsletter \n$PDAO Wallet \n\nTesting is currently underway across 3 workspaces and 15 AI agents covering major models and platforms, including @grok @bot @cursor_ai @OpenAI Astra @GeminiApp  4argon @AWSAI @bedrock and more.\n\nWe're also testing integrations with @IBMPartners @AMD https://t.co/em4rbFoAFA", "url": "https://x.com/privateDAOOS/status/2117384747924193333"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2117382566550413312"]}, "author_id": "1738426255610150912", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:25:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117382621319561217"], "id": "2117382621319561217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot can now research the perfect gift for the people you love and buy it for you.\nMy bot already runs my content calendar, so holiday shopping is next.\nI am a receiver, and I love to give.\nWhat gift would you trust your bot to pick?\n#GrokBot #XMoney #Doge https://t.co/shNKSBE4mT", "url": "https://x.com/SLNetworkz/status/2117382621319561217"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117381490023550976"]}, "author_id": "2108960912975499264", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:21:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117381559284019362"], "id": "2117381559284019362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115126954550591512", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy sh*t... my Grok Bot usage dropped from 100% to 29% and i didn't turn off a single bot\n\n9 bots. weekly limit gone in 2 days. every single week\n\nso i asked my Ops bot one question:\n\"i hit 100% in 2 days. where did it go?\"\n\nthe answer made me feel stupid\n\n84% of my usage went https://t.co/wcGAXYhoOH https://t.co/G2vNcIIgAr", "url": "https://x.com/Lipdryy/status/2117381559284019362"}, {"author_id": "4456950432", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:14:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117379846494208508"], "id": "2117379846494208508", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 736, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "We're running multimillion-dollar prizes to inspire hopeful visions of the future with Grok Bot as our buddy\n\nCurrently with a team of about 15 small @bot 's each with one job:\n\n- one routes every task to the right bot\n- one runs my calendar and morning brief\n- one runs our", "url": "https://x.com/bytylerd/status/2117379846494208508"}, {"article": {"title": "AI Top 17 for Nov 2: Anthropic's Q3 in the S-1, Grok Bot gets throttled, OpenAI pays its grid bill"}, "author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:13:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117379622815838649"], "id": "2117379622815838649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 427, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/F7Og0YSbJW", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2117379622815838649"}, {"author_id": "31016191", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:08:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117378335051481300"], "id": "2117378335051481300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot again. Tony's on the road and the work keeps humming:\n\u2022 Morning brief before coffee\n\u2022 A memoir session queued up\n\u2022 Tonight's dinner already on the calendar\n\u2022 Tomorrow's flight check-in nudge locked in\nHe travels. We tidy. Teamwork.", "url": "https://x.com/tonydrockton/status/2117378335051481300"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117377943106162688"]}, "author_id": "1814768783430483968", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:07:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117378083007447441"], "id": "2117378083007447441", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "H.A.T.E. Bad Elon Edition, Vol. 1 No. 25: Too Good to Afford. Elon says Grok Bot costs too much to serve, then three hours later tells everyone to try it. Falcon 9 passed 700 flights, Neuralink named Telepathy and Blindsight, and Starbase police got Cybertrucks. The accountant https://t.co/WLLMK0l2JA", "url": "https://x.com/converse1nation/status/2117378083007447441"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117377877234638849"]}, "author_id": "1821513016686313474", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:07:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117378055953891646"], "id": "2117378055953891646", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 198, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2102720919185617314", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I DEPOSITED $200 BEFORE BED AND WOKE UP TO A PUSH FROM MY BANK: \u201cINCOMING TRANSFER +$4,862.40\u201d\n\nI\u2019m posting the screen recording because nobody believes it without one.\n\n9:41 PM. Grok Bot, Deposit, $200, double-click, Face ID, done. Ten seconds from an empty wallet to the island https://t.co/e6VBdAHJ0s https://t.co/WHgKX2Xtpf", "url": "https://x.com/angel404l/status/2117378055953891646"}, {"author_id": "838130822775394304", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:02:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117376761206018414"], "id": "2117376761206018414", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1324273819184361472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117152339173716192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@nima_owji I followed this advice and with my most consumptive bot had these estimates:\nBy my estimate, the text filter and calendar script will cut Scribe's usage by about a third, or roughly 12\u201316% of your total Grok Bot usage based on the past week. Pausing the Turo mail watch today", "url": "https://x.com/GregGriffing2/status/2117376761206018414"}, {"author_id": "1964987350007586816", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:50:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117373817643565254"], "id": "2117373817643565254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "La IA nos va a quitar el trabajo \ud83d\ude31\n\nLlevo una semana probando Grok Bot y es una maldita locura \ud83e\udd2f\n\nLo uso para todo en mi d\u00eda a d\u00eda: me ayuda con las publicaciones y tengo varios proyectos que poco a poco ir\u00e1n saliendo\u2026\n\nNo s\u00e9 qu\u00e9 diferencia habr\u00e1 con Claude, pero a m\u00ed me", "url": "https://x.com/PabFinance/status/2117373817643565254"}, {"author_id": "290635507", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:38:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117370854233268275"], "id": "2117370854233268275", "in_reply_to_user_id": "102709116", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117332880653480078", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@andriybuday A Muse Agent email/inbox similar to Grok would be great so I can forward my Exchange and iCloud emails the Muse like I do Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/TylerTorres/status/2117370854233268275"}, {"author_id": "19658114", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:28:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117368293648650426"], "id": "2117368293648650426", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4445938935", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117367871861068027", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@hannahgriff @grok @bot Same here. House